* AMI three-level driver — EP/EM (0/5) → ±VDRV on the pair.
* 56 V back-to-back zeners (anode–anode) for surge; no forward clamp on signal.
.subckt AMI_TX EP EM TIP RING VDRV_P VDRV_N
Btip tip_i 0 V=v(VDRV_P)/5*v(EP)+v(VDRV_N)/5*v(EM)
Bring ring_i 0 V=-v(tip_i)
Rs_t tip_i TIP 50
Rs_r ring_i RING 50
* Bidirectional TVS ≈56 V: anode–anode zeners
Dz1 TIP tvs_m TVS56
Dz2 RING tvs_m TVS56
Rcm_t TIP 0 100k
Rcm_r RING 0 100k
.ends AMI_TX
